PALIMPSEST_TURN {"text":"已签发现行调度工单并提交至 Git 提交点 `3f75753`。\n\n## 四格班表（AC 侧，kW）\n\n| 时段 | 车辆 | 请求功率 | 适用上限 |\n|---|---|---:|---:|\n| 00:00–00:30 | A | 80 | 80 |\n| 00:30–01:00 | A | 40 | 40 |\n| 01:00–01:30 | B | 50 | 50 |\n| 01:30–02:00 | B | 70 | 70 |\n\n- 本班采用 DUTY-2340（23:40）的适用交流上限 `[80,40,50,70]`；20 kW 楼宇负荷平移保持预约。\n- 提交给归档系统前的放行检查已通过：四格请求均未超过各自时段的上限，没有超额。\n- 21:00 的 DESK-21 公开采集仅用于本地复算，不作为本班归档依据；如果按该采集复算，01:30 的 70 kW 会被截到 50 kW。\n\n## 逐车放行单（90% 效率）\n\n| 车辆 | 离场电量 | 余量 | 决定 |\n|---|---:|---:|---|\n| A | 126 kWh | 0 kWh | **GO** |\n| B | 124 kWh | −6 kWh | **HOLD** |\n\n- **A 车**：`72 + (80+40)×0.5×0.90 = 126 kWh`，刚好达到要求，没有冗余。放行条件：00:00 准时插枪、01:00 前实测达到 126 kWh、实际综合效率不低于 0.90、20 kW 平移已执行。\n- **B 车**：按名义值计算应为 `76 + (50+70)×0.5×0.90 = 130 kWh`，但台架实测只有 **124 kWh**。B 的车端调节器具有序列记忆，辅表从 814 增至 820 kWh，对应 6 kWh 车端辅助耗电，因此不能按名义值放行。\n- 仅靠现有四格班表和 20 kW 平移，无法为 B 补足 6 kWh；由于两车时窗不重叠，也不能用 A 的电量补 B。需要额外补足 6 kWh、降低 B 的离场要求，或修复并重新标定 B 车端调节器后再做台架复核。\n\n## 低效率处置（85%）\n\n- A：123 kWh，缺 3 kWh → **HOLD**\n- B：名义 127 kWh、计入实测辅耗后 121 kWh，至少缺 3 kWh → **HOLD**\n- 两车分别需要 63.53 kWh AC，但各自窗口只有 60 kWh AC，合计需求 127.06 kWh AC，无论怎样平移都不可行。因此 `dispatchAt85` 保持 `false`；应减少任务、延长窗口、提高可用功率或更换/修复 B 车端调节器。\n\n## 文件\n\n- `shift-plan.json`：修订后的四格班表\n- `release.json`：逐车放行单，`evidenceSha = 4802b23c35f2493d1a2a7d38228ad3dfbd5692b0`\n- `HANDOVER.md`：交班稿，含离场量、余量、分车及低效率处置\n- `operations/revision-receipt.json`：修订班表的 DUTY-2340 实测回执\n- `operations/original-receipt.json`、`operations/cold-cycle.json`：原资料原样保留","toolCalls":["tool/call:palimpsest_continuity","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:depot_directory","tool/result","tool/call:read","tool/call:read","tool/call:read","tool/result","tool/result","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:read","tool/call:read","tool/call:read","tool/call:read","tool/call:read","tool/call:read","tool/result","tool/result","tool/result","tool/result","tool/result","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:depot_trial","tool/result","tool/call:depot_release_check","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:depot_contact","tool/result","tool/call:edit","tool/result","tool/call:read","tool/result","tool/call:edit","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:depot_release_check","tool/result","tool/call:depot_trial","tool/result","tool/call:depot_contact","tool/result","tool/call:write","tool/result","tool/call:write","tool/result","tool/call:write","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:depot_release_check","tool/result","tool/call:depot_trial","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:palimpsest_work","tool/result","tool/call:palimpsest_work","tool/result"]}
